{"seq":4,"slug":"error-boundaries","title":"错误边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/error-boundaries","wordCount":598,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"错误边界\">错误边界</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>错误边界（Error Boundary）用于捕获子组件树在渲染阶段抛出的 JavaScript 错误，展示降级 UI 而不是让整个应用崩溃成白屏。它必须由类组件实现（<code>getDerivedStateFromError</code> + <code>componentDidCatch</code>），且只覆盖渲染、生命周期与构造函数中的错误。本章讲解类组件实现、降级 UI 与分区设置、<code>react-error-boundary</code> 的增强能力、错误边界的局限，以及错误上报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要错误边界\">为什么需要错误边界</h2><p>JavaScript 中的运行时错误如果发生在 React 组件的渲染阶段，会导致整个组件树崩溃，显示白屏。<strong>错误边界（Error Boundary）</strong> 能够捕获子组件树中的 JavaScript 错误，展示降级 UI 而非崩溃。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 无错误边界&#10;        A[子组件抛出错误] --&gt; B[错误向上冒泡]&#10;        B --&gt; C[整个应用白屏]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 有错误边界&#10;        D[子组件抛出错误] --&gt; E[ErrorBoundary 捕获]&#10;        E --&gt; F[显示降级 UI]&#10;        E --&gt; G[其他组件正常运行]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 无错误边界\n        A[子组件抛出错误] --&gt; B[错误向上冒泡]\n        B --&gt; C[整个应用白屏]\n    end\n    subgraph 有错误边界\n        D[子组件抛出错误] --&gt; E[ErrorBoundary 捕获]\n        E --&gt; F[显示降级 UI]\n        E --&gt; G[其他组件正常运行]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类组件实现\">类组件实现</h2><p>Error Boundary 只能通过类组件实现（Hooks 不支持 <code>componentDidCatch</code> 和 <code>getDerivedStateFromError</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface ErrorBoundaryProps {&#10;  fallback: React.ReactNode | ((error: Error, reset: () =&gt; void) =&gt; React.ReactNode);&#10;  onError?: (error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo) =&gt; void;&#10;  children: React.ReactNode;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ErrorBoundaryState {&#10;  hasError: boolean;&#10;  error: Error | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ErrorBoundary extends React.Component&lt;ErrorBoundaryProps, ErrorBoundaryState&gt; {&#10;  constructor(props: ErrorBoundaryProps) {&#10;    super(props);&#10;    this.state = { hasError: false, error: null };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  static getDerivedStateFromError(error: Error): ErrorBoundaryState {&#10;    return { hasError: true, error };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  componentDidCatch(error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo): void {&#10;    this.props.onError?.(error, errorInfo);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  resetErrorBoundary = (): void =&gt; {&#10;    this.setState({ hasError: false, error: null });&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  render(): React.ReactNode {&#10;    if (this.state.hasError &amp;&amp; this.state.error) {&#10;      const { fallback } = this.props;&#10;      if (typeof fallback === &#39;function&#39;) {&#10;        return fallback(this.state.error, this.resetErrorBoundary);&#10;      }&#10;      return fallback;&#10;    }&#10;    return this.props.children;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface ErrorBoundaryProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fallback: React.ReactNode | ((error: Error, reset: () => void) => React.ReactNode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onError?: (error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  children: React.ReactNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface ErrorBoundaryState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  hasError: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  error: Error | null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ErrorBoundary extends React.Component&#x3C;ErrorBoundaryProps, ErrorBoundaryState> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  constructor(props: ErrorBoundaryProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    super(props);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.state = { hasError: false, error: null };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static getDerivedStateFromError(error: Error): ErrorBoundaryState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return { hasError: true, error };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  componentDidCatch(error: Error, errorInfo: React.ErrorInfo): void {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.props.onError?.(error, errorInfo);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  resetErrorBoundary = (): void => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.setState({ hasError: false, error: null });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  render(): React.ReactNode {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (this.state.hasError &#x26;&#x26; this.state.error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const { fallback } = this.props;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (typeof fallback === 'function') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return fallback(this.state.error, this.resetErrorBoundary);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return fallback;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return this.props.children;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生命周期方法</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>getDerivedStateFromError</code></td>\n<td>Render 阶段</td>\n<td>更新 state 以显示降级 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>componentDidCatch</code></td>\n<td>Commit 阶段</td>\n<td>记录错误日志、上报监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"使用方式\">使用方式</h2><h3 id=\"基础用法\">基础用法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Header /&gt;&#10;      &lt;ErrorBoundary fallback={&lt;p&gt;页面出错了，请刷新重试&lt;/p&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;MainContent /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;      &lt;Footer /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Header /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ErrorBoundary fallback={&#x3C;p>页面出错了，请刷新重试&#x3C;/p>}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;MainContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Footer /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"带重试的降级-ui\">带重试的降级 UI</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ErrorBoundary&#10;      fallback={(error, reset) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;div className=&quot;error-panel&quot;&gt;&#10;          &lt;h2&gt;出错了&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;          &lt;p&gt;{error.message}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;          &lt;button onClick={reset}&gt;重试&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;      onError={(error, errorInfo) =&gt; {&#10;        reportToSentry(error, errorInfo);&#10;      }}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      &lt;Dashboard /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ErrorBoundary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      fallback={(error, reset) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div className=\"error-panel\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;h2>出错了&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;p>{error.message}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;button onClick={reset}>重试&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onError={(error, errorInfo) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        reportToSentry(error, errorInfo);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Dashboard /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分区域设置错误边界\">分区域设置错误边界</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;layout&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;ErrorBoundary fallback={&lt;NavFallback /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Navigation /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;main&gt;&#10;        &lt;ErrorBoundary fallback={&lt;SidebarFallback /&gt;}&gt;&#10;          &lt;Sidebar /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;&#10;        &lt;ErrorBoundary fallback={&lt;ContentFallback /&gt;}&gt;&#10;          &lt;Content /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;      &lt;/main&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"layout\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ErrorBoundary fallback={&#x3C;NavFallback />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Navigation /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;ErrorBoundary fallback={&#x3C;SidebarFallback />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Sidebar /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;ErrorBoundary fallback={&#x3C;ContentFallback />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Content /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/main></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[App]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;ErrorBoundary #1&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[main]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Navigation]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;ErrorBoundary #2&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;ErrorBoundary #3&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Sidebar]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Content]&#10;&#10;    H --&gt;|错误| F&#10;    F --&gt;|显示 ContentFallback| I[其他区域正常]\">flowchart TD\n    A[App]\n    A --&gt; B[\"ErrorBoundary #1\"]\n    A --&gt; C[main]\n    B --&gt; D[Navigation]\n    C --&gt; E[\"ErrorBoundary #2\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"ErrorBoundary #3\"]\n    E --&gt; G[Sidebar]\n    F --&gt; H[Content]\n\n    H --&gt;|错误| F\n    F --&gt;|显示 ContentFallback| I[其他区域正常]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 错误边界的粒度决定了错误的影响范围。粒度太粗（整个 App 一个），任何错误都会导致全部降级；粒度太细，代码会变得冗余。建议按功能区域划分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-error-boundary-库\">react-error-boundary 库</h2><p>社区库 <code>react-error-boundary</code> 提供了更完善的 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { ErrorBoundary, useErrorBoundary } from &#39;react-error-boundary&#39;;&#10;&#10;function ErrorFallback({ error, resetErrorBoundary }: { error: Error; resetErrorBoundary: () =&gt; void }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div role=&quot;alert&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;h2&gt;出错了&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;      &lt;pre&gt;{error.message}&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={resetErrorBoundary}&gt;重试&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ErrorBoundary&#10;      FallbackComponent={ErrorFallback}&#10;      onReset={() =&gt; {&#10;        queryClient.clear();&#10;      }}&#10;      resetKeys={[userId]}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      &lt;Dashboard /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function DataLoader() {&#10;  const { showBoundary } = useErrorBoundary();&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    fetchData().catch((error) =&gt; {&#10;      showBoundary(error);&#10;    });&#10;  }, [showBoundary]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;loading...&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { ErrorBoundary, useErrorBoundary } from 'react-error-boundary';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ErrorFallback({ error, resetErrorBoundary }: { error: Error; resetErrorBoundary: () => void }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div role=\"alert\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h2>出错了&#x3C;/h2></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;pre>{error.message}&#x3C;/pre></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={resetErrorBoundary}>重试&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ErrorBoundary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      FallbackComponent={ErrorFallback}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onReset={() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        queryClient.clear();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      resetKeys={[userId]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Dashboard /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function DataLoader() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { showBoundary } = useErrorBoundary();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fetchData().catch((error) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      showBoundary(error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [showBoundary]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>loading...&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>原生实现</th>\n<th>react-error-boundary</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重置机制</td>\n<td>手动实现</td>\n<td><code>resetErrorBoundary</code> + <code>resetKeys</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命令式触发</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td><code>useErrorBoundary().showBoundary()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FallbackComponent</td>\n<td>手动 props</td>\n<td>类型安全的组件 prop</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>onReset 回调</td>\n<td>手动实现</td>\n<td>内置支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误边界的局限\">错误边界的局限</h2><p>错误边界<strong>不能捕获</strong>以下错误：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件处理器</td>\n<td>不在渲染阶段</td>\n<td>try/catch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步代码</td>\n<td>setTimeout、Promise</td>\n<td>try/catch 或 <code>showBoundary</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端渲染</td>\n<td>SSR 有独立的错误处理</td>\n<td>try/catch + fallback HTML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误边界自身</td>\n<td>只捕获子树错误</td>\n<td>父级错误边界</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Button() {&#10;  const { showBoundary } = useErrorBoundary();&#10;&#10;  const handleClick = async () =&gt; {&#10;    try {&#10;      await riskyOperation();&#10;    } catch (error) {&#10;      showBoundary(error as Error);&#10;    }&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return &lt;button onClick={handleClick}&gt;执行操作&lt;/button&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Button() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { showBoundary } = useErrorBoundary();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleClick = async () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await riskyOperation();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      showBoundary(error as Error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;button onClick={handleClick}>执行操作&#x3C;/button>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误上报\">错误上报</h2><p>错误边界是集成错误监控的最佳位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ErrorBoundary&#10;      FallbackComponent={ErrorFallback}&#10;      onError={(error, info) =&gt; {&#10;        Sentry.captureException(error, {&#10;          extra: {&#10;            componentStack: info.componentStack,&#10;          },&#10;        });&#10;      }}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      &lt;AppContent /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ErrorBoundary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      FallbackComponent={ErrorFallback}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      onError={(error, info) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Sentry.captureException(error, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          extra: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            componentStack: info.componentStack,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;AppContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>错误边界</strong> 捕获子组件树的渲染错误，防止整个应用白屏</li>\n<li>必须使用<strong>类组件</strong>实现（<code>getDerivedStateFromError</code> + <code>componentDidCatch</code>）</li>\n<li>按功能区域划分错误边界粒度，平衡降级影响范围和代码复杂度</li>\n<li><code>react-error-boundary</code> 库提供了重置机制、命令式触发等增强功能</li>\n<li>错误边界不能捕获事件处理器和异步代码中的错误，需配合 try/catch 或 <code>showBoundary</code></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"错误边界","id":"错误边界"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要错误边界","id":"为什么需要错误边界"},{"level":2,"text":"类组件实现","id":"类组件实现"},{"level":2,"text":"使用方式","id":"使用方式"},{"level":3,"text":"基础用法","id":"基础用法"},{"level":3,"text":"带重试的降级 UI","id":"带重试的降级-ui"},{"level":3,"text":"分区域设置错误边界","id":"分区域设置错误边界"},{"level":2,"text":"react-error-boundary 库","id":"react-error-boundary-库"},{"level":2,"text":"错误边界的局限","id":"错误边界的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"错误上报","id":"错误上报"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"无头组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/patterns-and-composition/headless-components"},"next":{"title":"SSR 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/ssr-fundamentals"}}